    tags: ['actualise', 'support', 'about', 'security', 'organizational security', 'password'],
    content: `You've learned about the organisation’s needs, you've taken steps to build awareness and trust with the staff, and you've created a plan with the organisation's input. Now it's time to implement the tools, practices and policies that will make the organization more safe. This section collects recommendations for turning your plan into action.In this section:Organizational security by topic: Information management Secure Organisational Communications Password management Physical security Travel Creating organisational security policies Helpful networks for support providers - Where support providers can find additional support and troubleshoot helpAdditional topics we'd like to add to this section:Organizational security by topic: Infrastructure Hosting / Web presence`,
