    category: 'security',
    tags: ['discover', 'research', 'about', 'security', 'threat'],
    content: `¶ Context and threat research resources/referencesContext research https://safetag.org/guide/#section4.1 (and linked exercises) chapter of SAFETAG in Full Guide (PDF linked from https://safetag.org/#audit) (Source: https://github.com/OpenInternet/SAFETAG/tree/master/en/methods/context_research) Specifically, a large collection of resources at https://SAFETAG.org/guide/index.html#section4.1.11 (Source: https://github.com/OpenInternet/SAFETAG/blob/master/en/references/context_research.md) SAFETAG THREAT BY REGION REFERENCES https://github.com/OpenInternet/SAFETAG/blob/master/en/references/threat_by_region.md and https://github.com/OpenInternet/SAFETAG/issues/247 ) Cyber Stewards Network: https://cyberstewards.org/browse-by-regions/¶ InfrastructureITU Statistics on internet/mobile penetration TeleGeography's Submarine Cable Map http://www.submarinecablemap.com/ Comms and Device taxation related to Internet penetration¶ RSS feedsKaspersky - https://threatpost.com/ Ars Technica - http://arstechnica.com/security/`,
