    tags: ['actualise', 'physical security', 'about', 'security'],
    content: `¶ ResourcesFront Line Defenders TRAINING RESOURCES ( https://www.frontlinedefenders.org/security-training)+) Workbook on Security: Practical Steps for Human Rights Defenders at Risk Protection Manual for Human Rights Defenders (Long and Short versions) York University Online Course in Human Rights Physical Security https://www.york.ac.uk/cahr/studying/online Protection International Manuals http://www.protectioninternational.org/publication/new-protection-manual-for-human-rights-defenders-3rd-edition/ Protection International Online Courses https://e-learning.protectioninternational.org/ SAFETAG resources via https://github.com/OpenInternet/SAFETAG/blob/master/en/references/physical_assessment.md: Guide: "Physical Penetration Test" (About The Penetration Testing Execution Standard) Checklist: "Check list: Office Security" (Frontline Defenders) Manual: Planning, improving and checking security in offices and homes Guide: "Physical Security Assessment - pg. 122" (OSTTM)`,
